    "type": "categorical",
    "value": "Public PII at scale = (PUBLIC_PII_KEYWORDS match) AND (LARGE_VOLUME_KEYWORDS match OR org-wide / cross-tenant blast radius). Either weak signal alone is insufficient.",
  },
  "riskScorer_scopeCreep_ratioBands": {
